# The public API analyzer's severities are not set here but in Bayeux.Client.Extensible.csproj
# (WarningsAsErrors). A [*.cs] section only applies to diagnostics reported against .cs files, and
# RS0017 - an entry for a member that no longer exists - is reported against PublicAPI.Unshipped.txt,
# so it stayed a warning and a removed member did not fail the build.
